    - target: {fileID: 2091975455040809692, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Enc - Final Battle
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2091975455040809692, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.size
      value: 34
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[0].Text
      value: Ah hah! There you are, fiends!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[1].Text
      value: "Didn\u2019t we kill this guy like twice already?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[2].Text
      value: Ah hah, you will ever be on your quest for the cheese thief, never getting
        closer, ever getting farther.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[3].Text
      value: "\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[4].Text
      value: Um, well you may not have realised, but perhaps I, Billius Ronaldorico
        Bleatario may have knowledge related to the cheese and the cheese thief,
        who perhaps is not a thief at all!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[5].Text
      value: "\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[6].Text
      value: Since you have obviously realised, yes you are correct, my true name
        is Edamulous Billius Fromagearico Ronaldorico Bleaterio.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[7].Text
      value: And yes... I was the one helping to harbour the cheese.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[8].Text
      value: So you were the cheese thief, meow! How could you? We trusted you!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[9].Text
      value: Your trust is a sign of your foolish, kindly nature, cat. But I was
        not and am not a thief.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[10].Text
      value: "Let\u2019s kill him, for real this time."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[11].Text
      value: "Wait! Wait! I\u2019m really not a thief! This is the true nature of
        the thief. Or rather, not a thief at all!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[12].Text
      value: "\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[13].Text
      value: We ran...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[14].Text
      value: From the rats...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[15].Text
      value: The cheese... Talked, meow?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[16].Text
      value: So you see, there was no cheese thief.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[17].Text
      value: How is this possible?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[18].Text
      value: Well you see.. I have always been a great lover of cheese. Long ago
        I sought to venture to the rat village because of their infamous delicious
        cheddar.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[19].Text
      value: To my shock, to my horror, when I visited I found out that the cheese...
        Was alive...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[20].Text
      value: The rats care not for morality or the sentience of others. They care
        only of the delicious taste to keep their bellies and coffers filled.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[21].Text
      value: 'So you see now, the truth was as simple as this...

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[22].Text
      value: "The cheese\u2026 matured... And became sentient."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[23].Text
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[24].Text
      value: I simply sought to protect the cheese from the rats and yourselves who
        would return the cheese to them.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[25].Text
      value: So, what will you choose?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[26].Text
      value: Will you allow the cheese to live their lives in peace? Or will you
        return them to the rats to get your reward?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[27].Text
      value: "That\u2019s awful, meow!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[28].Text
      value: So what should we do?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[29].Text
      value: Obviously we return the cheese to the rats and get our reward.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[30].Text
      value: "I thought it may come to this\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[31].Text
      value: I, Edamulous Billius Fromagearico Ronaldorico Bleaterio call upon you,
        my children...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[32].Text
      value: Fight alongside me for your lives, your sentience, and your freedom!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
        type: 3}
      propertyPath: DialogueList.Array.data[33].Text
      value: Cheese army arise!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2546531012254417142, guid: e61d923b2ace4264e9b1d7f3fac82905,
